	"data": "Hindsight Implementation Analysis\n\nDeep research dive — September 25, 2026\nResearcher: Calcifer (subagent)\nStatus: Complete analysis, ready for review\n\nExecutive Summary\n\nHindsight (Vectorize.io, MIT, arXiv:2512.12818) has matured significantly since our last research pass in August 2026. It's now at v0.9.x with 22.7K+ GitHub stars, an official OpenClaw plugin, an Obsidian integration, and SOTA results on both LongMemEval (91.4%) and the new BEAM 10M benchmark (64.1%). The architecture decision…",
